    "description_html": "<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">👻 <strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Keep it Spooky and Fun with our \"Creepin' it Real\" 3D Pop-up Halloween Card!</strong> 🦇</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Looking for a show-stopping card for Halloween or a spooky October birthday? This incredibly detailed 3D pop-up card combines the fun of a tiered cake with the chills of a haunted house, guaranteed to thrill anyone who opens it!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">✨ What makes this card so special?</strong> As the card opens, a magnificent two-tiered black \"cake\" rises, intricately designed as a haunted gothic castle. It is topped with a vintage-style \"Creepin' it real\" sign, swirly lollipops, skulls, and adorable ghosts. The base of the card features a spooky graveyard path, glowing Jack-o'-lanterns, and a silhouette of a witch flying across a vibrant purple and pink night sky.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">📐 Specifications:</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Folded Size:</strong> 5 x 7 inches (Standard size, perfect for gifting and display).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Open Size:</strong> 10 x 7 inches with a striking 3D pop-up centerpiece.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material:</strong> Premium Art Paper. Thick, durable, and eco-friendly with vibrant, fade-resistant colors.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Craftsmanship:</strong> Precision laser-cut for the finest details, then 100% hand-assembled with love and care.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
